  src/sdk/core-governance.ts,project,re-exports the analyzers into the public surface at lines 29-30 without wiring a consumer
  src/sdk/provenance.ts,project,both analyzers live here and have no consumer outside their own spec
tests[1]{command,scope,timeout_seconds}:
  node scripts/run-tests.mjs test -- provenance,project,300
